	"notice": "Connect the TB-3 MIDI input and enable MIDI transmission on the hardware. The factory MIDI channel is 2; channel 0 in Harmoneasy listens to all channels. These controls generate MIDI into this chain and do not configure or send audio from the hardware. Scatter controls are receive-only and are not shown as input controls. Configurable surface controls use virtual defaults; match your hardware preset with MIDI learn or edit note/CC/channel mappings. Keyboard surfaces start at MIDI note 48.",
